// Per-object part override in the init list: b1 overrides Led.pin, b2 keeps
// the module default. The module rule reads its own Led.pin back into P so the
// harness can observe the per-instance config.

#module Blinker
#digital Led out 0
#variable P
P = Led.pin ? 1
#end

#Blinker b1 Led.pin=13
#Blinker b2
